        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2670] If the EVCC selected the service parameter \"MobilityNeedsMode\" set to 2 and the SECC received new values for departure time, target SOC or minimum SOC from a secondary actor, the SECC shall include those updated values in DepartureTime, TargetSOC or MinimumSOC, respectively. If TargetSOC or MinimumSOC are included, then the SECC shall also include AckMaxDelay.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
                1229,
                1120,
