        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2671] If the EVCC selected the service parameter MobilityNeedsMode set to 2 and receives a DC_ChargeLoopRes message with DepartureTime, TargetSOC or MinimumSOC, and if the EVCC accepts this DepartureTime, TargetSOC or MinimumSOC, then the EVCC shall send updated values in a DC_ChargeLoopReq within the number of seconds stated in AckMaxDelay of DC_ChargeLoopRes.",
